test_mcp_docker	Build and push	2026-10-22T19:10:31.7371318Z             "body": "This draft preserves original local stdio MCP and adds bounded batch/jobs, private profiles/artifacts, production packaging, lifecycle controls and fork-specific installation. Publishing remains disabled; release acceptance is blocked.\n\nCurrent candidate3a5b901 closes installed-fixture evidence gaps: controller/parent-death workspaces require completed acceptance as well as cleanup before removal; profile/jobs close errors propagate with the primary cause, including final-close failures. The installed journal smoke already has the same guard. Failed workspaces are retained on the executing host, without exporting database/key contents. The Windows cleanup-confirmed marker follows all existing cleanup attempts. Parent-death's initial process observation is recorded before kill/assertions, including full same-snapshot Windows legacy/rows without role/name/age/window filtering. Stderr survives default execFileSync failure; stdout's acceptance receipt is preserved. No signal authority, ownership matcher, lease policy or action/RPC/cleanup/job limit change.\n\nIndependent stock Playwright PCM and single-PNG references now compare the Windows media and Mac capture failures without MCP. Projects retain matching engines/channels and the shared headless option; browser/page lifecycle belongs to Playwright. PCM observes5s preload then a real button activation before strict assertions; later playback cannot waive failed preload. Screenshot captures one320×240 red viewport with a5s bound, no warmup/retry. Original MCP media test body is byte-identical; shared WAV bytes are identical32044/SHA-256 be091bc7a72f0cbfc5a10f648931ef796502c503e273e1b49c520d764afaa273. Original tests remain intact; references are additive.\n\nValidation: actual-script baselines reproduce deletion/error suppression; six negative/six healthy controller/profile/parent-death cases pass their calibration assertions on Node22/24. Jobs combined/final-close/healthy cases verify both causes, retention/removal and scoped owned0; a combined profile case preserves its original cause. Parent observation forwarding is verified with actual positive/negative/linger lifetimes; Windows full-row branch awaits native. Final stock PCM/PNG4/4 each Node20/22/24 passes locally on actual Chromium/Firefox engines; Chrome/WebKit/native comparison pending. Frozen-source fresh production install/check passes on Node22 and current source hashes still match. Typecheck/lint/actionlint pass (shellcheck/pyflakes disabled).297-file dry package excludes test references/actions/evidence. Negative calibrations are not native/production passes.\n\nLatest completed native93 at47d9c21: [batch](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39824763343)1424 pass/1 fail; [original](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39824763264)576/5; completed summaries2000/6. Windows main unexecuted after package check fails. Other four package steps and all four component lanes pass, including all12 actual write-lock schema/version/identity race cases again. Linux main207/211/211 pass; Mac210/1. All17 logs recovered after two empty-error reads and ordinary retries; no cancellation request.\n\nWindows journal/guardian installed checks and regular parent-death check pass, then linger-close parent-death create RPC times out. No init phase/worker-exit flag in that receipt; native92 directory/init/exit-false remains a separate unresolved case. Actual Codex1k passes all3 OSs (35.461/38.443/80.591s, model0/owned0); Mac raw1k times out967. Separate Mac server/pipe1k controls pass116.143/112.997s, owned0. These do not clear native89 Windows CRASHED750, native87 scoped observation or historical136/142 birth gaps.\n\nOriginal failures: Windows WebKit WAV/VP9 readiness, legacy headed Firefox action failure, two Mac Chromium Page.captureScreenshot errors (highlight and video-source paint). Trace/PDF/large-DOM each pass all12 native cases. Actual-gray gate ineligible; no fresh controls or independent decoder measurement. Native90 gray cause remains unresolved; no speculative encoder patch, unsafe replay or assertion waiver.\n\nG00–G18 in docs/CODEX_EXECUTION_LEDGER.md and docs/evidence/native93-summary.json retain full scopes, logs and pending cases. No merge/publication/default transport change or ownership-debt clearance.",
